<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Jan-Mar unemployment 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Jan-Mar unemployment 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department gave on Thursday the following seasonally adjusted figures as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Jan-Mar*  Dec-Feb   Sep-Nov   Dec-Feb</p>
<p>			 1997     1996/97    1996     1995/96</p>
<p> Unemployment	2.5	 2.4	 2.7	 3.1</p>
<p> Underemployment   1.1	 1.2	 1.5	 2.2</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
